{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"top p for network response diversity top p for network response diversity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","fileName":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Model and Prompt Engineering]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"top p for network response diversity top p for network response diversity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","fileName":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity","heading":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Top-p, or nucleus sampling, restricts token selection to the smallest group whose cumulative probability reaches a chosen threshold. Lowering the threshold narrows the candidate set and generally makes an answer less diverse; raising it permits more alternatives.\n\nFor network automation, a narrow response space can support consistency, but it does not prove that the selected command is valid for the target platform. Changing top-p and [[Temperature for Network Response Variability]] at the same time also makes experiments hard to interpret. One control should be varied at a time against a stable prompt and evaluation set.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"top p for network response diversity top p for network response diversity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","fileName":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Top-P for Network Response Diversity","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}